      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs8AAAABL22tyQ",
      "title": "validation: add op-contracts/v9.0.0-rc.1 standard versions",
      "author": "maurelian",
      "number": 1395,
      "body": "OPCM 9.0.3 deployed on Sepolia and Mainnet from https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism/releases/tag/op-contracts/v9.0.0-rc.1\r\ntag (ba6fcadbc57eb99918c5b0f14f57c72527f531e3). \r\n\r\nAddresses are from the op-deployer bootstrap outputs, the versions were set by reading back the deployed implementations.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
