    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs8AAAABL0WGbA",
      "title": "sepolia-devnet-3: remove unused op_contracts_manager_addr",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1394,
      "body": "Removes `op_contracts_manager_addr` from `superchain/configs/sepolia-devnet-3/superchain.toml`.\n\nSame cleanup as #1304 did for sepolia-devnet-2: the field is dead (nothing reads it; op-deployer and op-chain-ops take the OPCM from `validation/standard/standard-versions-*.toml`, superchain-ops tasks from `[addresses] OPCM` in their own config). It was also stale here: it pointed at a 7.1.17 dev OPCM (`0xe5dF…0491`), while the chain has been on op-contracts/v8.0.0 via the standard v8.0.1 OPCM since superchain-ops task `sep/107-U20-sepolia-devnet-2-3`. After this, no superchain config carries the field.\n\n`go run ./cmd/codegen --superchains=sepolia-devnet-3` produces no further changes.\n\nPart of the staging rollout plan for the U21/U22 rehearsal (stage 3, registry): https://claude.ai/artifact/2paKyAKczPJxM75dQhncVr\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-30T16:59:51Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-10-30T18:00:34Z",
      "additions": 0,
      "deletions": 1
    }
  ],
